Subject: [PATCH] feat: compress API responses using gzip

Trade history responses can easily reach several MB, which makes
loading them slow - especially over a network connection.

Add Starlette's GZipMiddleware to compress responses larger than 1KB
(1.4MB of trade history compresses down to ~185KB).
This can be disabled with "enable_gzip": false in the api_server
configuration.
